# Non-case constructor arm does not bind the payload variable (T-1154).
# [Shape.Circle payload]: fires (match succeeds) but payload is NOT bound.
# Using payload.r in the body gives E002.
# Correct form: [case [let payload] [Shape.Circle payload] payload.r]
[
  Shape: [type Circle: [r: Int]]
  sh:    [Shape.Circle r: 5]
  area:  [match sh
    [Shape.Circle payload]: payload.r
    _:                      0]
]
=== error
undefined variable: payload (did you mean the string "payload"? Use quotes.) (defined at 8:22-8:29) (accessed at 8:22-8:29)
